WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
[Music]

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Labeled MRI datasets are expensive.
Tumors vary widely in size, shape and position.

3
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:08.740
TumorLytix: unsupervised brain tumor detection and segmentation
No manual labels.

4
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:13.110
Paired images from unpaired scans.
CycleGAN on 23,180 healthy and 41,892 diseased slices from 369 patients

5
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:17.470
Over 90% segmentation accuracy
65,072 MRI images, no manual labels

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.840
Versus a plain CycleGAN
25% fewer artifacts, 30% higher precision, 50% faster convergence, 1.6x images per second

7
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.500
